{"id":"07adad8c036296f7","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-type.md","title":"Type","display":"df-type — Type","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-type","aliases":["17-df-type"],"display":"df-type — Type","depends_on":["[[17-df-formula]]","[[17-df-free-variable]]","[[17-df-sentence]]","[[17-df-assignment]]","[[17-df-satisfaction]]","[[17-df-model]]","[[17-df-first-order-language]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","source_verification":"not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed","legacy_label":"17-df-1.8.1"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-type"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-type</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-type — Type"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"465b5002eb16d1cf\" href=\"?note=465b5002eb16d1cf\" title=\"17-df-formula\">17-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"58507ea1921a657e\" href=\"?note=58507ea1921a657e\" title=\"17-df-free-variable\">17-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9b641c11eab6e875\" href=\"?note=9b641c11eab6e875\" title=\"17-df-assignment\">17-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ec1305482f8eec2e\" href=\"?note=ec1305482f8eec2e\" title=\"17-df-satisfaction\">17-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-1.8.1"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i=v_i\">\\(x_i=v_i\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;n\">\\(i&lt;n\\)</span>）取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a> 的变量序列。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Form}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Form}_L\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-formulas, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"465b5002eb16d1cf\" href=\"?note=465b5002eb16d1cf\" title=\"17-df-formula\">17-df-formula</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeVar}\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeVar}\\)</span> (free-variable operation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"58507ea1921a657e\" href=\"?note=58507ea1921a657e\" title=\"17-df-free-variable\">17-df-free-variable</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\)</span> (models of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}\\)</span> (assignments, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"9b641c11eab6e875\" href=\"?note=9b641c11eab6e875\" title=\"17-df-assignment\">17-df-assignment</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sat}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{Sat}_L\\)</span> (satisfaction, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"ec1305482f8eec2e\" href=\"?note=ec1305482f8eec2e\" title=\"17-df-satisfaction\">17-df-satisfaction</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n},\\operatorname{Type}_n,S_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n},\\operatorname{Type}_n,S_n\\)</span> (sets defined here)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\n&amp;=\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L:\n\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1}\\}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Type}_n(T)\n&amp;=\\bigl\\{p\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}:\n\\exists\\mathfrak{A}\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n\\exists s\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak{A}|)\\;\n\\forall\\varphi\\in p\\;\n\\operatorname{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak{A},s,\\varphi)\n\\bigr\\},\\\\\nS_n(T)\n&amp;=\\bigl\\{p\\in\\operatorname{Type}_n(T):\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\\;\n(\\varphi\\in p\\lor\\neg\\varphi\\in p)\n\\bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\n&amp;=\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L:\n\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1}\\}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Type}_n(T)\n&amp;=\\bigl\\{p\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}:\n\\exists\\mathfrak{A}\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n\\exists s\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak{A}|)\\;\n\\forall\\varphi\\in p\\;\n\\operatorname{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak{A},s,\\varphi)\n\\bigr\\},\\\\\nS_n(T)\n&amp;=\\bigl\\{p\\in\\operatorname{Type}_n(T):\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\\;\n(\\varphi\\in p\\lor\\neg\\varphi\\in p)\n\\bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Members of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Type}_n(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Type}_n(T)\\)</span> are partial <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-types consistent with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>;\nmembers of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_n(T)\">\\(S_n(T)\\)</span> are complete <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-types.  The witnessing assignment gives a\nsemantic consistency condition without applying the sentence-consistency\npredicate to open formulas.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"465b5002eb16d1cf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"58507ea1921a657e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"9b641c11eab6e875","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"ec1305482f8eec2e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\omega$；$x_i=v_i$（$i<n$）取 [[17-df-first-order-language]] 的变量序列。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T$ ($T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$, see [[17-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"465b5002eb16d1cf","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Form}_L$ ($L$-formulas, see [[17-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"58507ea1921a657e","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FreeVar}$ (free-variable operation, see [[17-df-free-variable]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ (models of $T$, see [[17-df-model]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"9b641c11eab6e875","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Assign}$ (assignments, see [[17-df-assignment]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"ec1305482f8eec2e","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Sat}_L$ (satisfaction, see [[17-df-satisfaction]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"x_i=v_i","display":false},{"tex":"i<n","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Form}_L","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FreeVar}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Mod}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assign}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sat}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n},\\operatorname{Type}_n,S_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\n&=\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L:\n\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1}\\}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Type}_n(T)\n&=\\bigl\\{p\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}:\n\\exists\\mathfrak{A}\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n\\exists s\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak{A}|)\\;\n\\forall\\varphi\\in p\\;\n\\operatorname{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak{A},s,\\varphi)\n\\bigr\\},\\\\\nS_n(T)\n&=\\bigl\\{p\\in\\operatorname{Type}_n(T):\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\\;\n(\\varphi\\in p\\lor\\neg\\varphi\\in p)\n\\bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Type}_n(T)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"S_n(T)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false}],"bytes":1882,"backlinks":[{"id":"caec72ff0a2438f3","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$ (formulas in $n$ displayed variables, see [[17-df-type]])"},{"id":"6c973042c939008f","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S_1$ (complete $1$-types, see [[17-df-type]])"},{"id":"401bc4f750ae4719","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$ (formulas in $x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1}$, see [[17-df-type]])"},{"id":"49d62977f4c49d09","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$；$\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$ 与参数满足关系见 [[17-df-type]]、[[17-df-satisfaction]]。"},{"id":"9c54640eb3282127","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$ (formulas in the variables $x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1}$, see [[17-df-type]])"},{"id":"b0923b75f2632493","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 为一阶语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$，见 [[17-df-sentence]]；$n\\in\\omega$ 且 $\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$，见 [[17-df-type]]。$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ 见 [[17-df-model]]；$\\operatorname{Realizes}_{L,n}$ 见 [[17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets]]；$\\varphi\\models_T\\psi$ 取 [[17-df-complete-formula]] 的相对后承。以下在这些输入上定义 $\\operatorname{LocallyRealizes}_{T,n}$ 与 $\\operatorname{LocallyOmits}_{T,n}$；语言由 $T$ 的指定语境 $L$ 固定。"},{"id":"de5d3e9530a68ea0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 为一阶语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ 见 [[17-df-sentence]]；$\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$ 与完整型空间 $S_n(T)$ 取 [[17-df-type]]。$p$ 是候选公式集。以下定义的 $\\operatorname{Isolated}_T(p)$ 和 $\\operatorname{NonIsolated}_T(p)$ 同时适用于全部有限元数；$n$ 在定义式内局部绑定，不是调用处隐藏的自由参数。"},{"id":"0626faf5263e31f8","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S_1(T_{\\mathfrak A,B})$ (complete $1$-types over $B$, see [[17-df-type]])"},{"id":"a29b7cd698a7afca","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n,m\\in\\omega$, $\\bar x=\\langle x_i:i<n\\rangle$, $\\bar y=\\langle x_{n+j}:j<m\\rangle$, and $\\varphi(\\bar x;\\bar y)\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n+m}$; the displayed blocks cover all free variables. Formula syntax is from [[17-df-formula]], and $\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n+m}$ is from [[17-df-type]]."},{"id":"f21d04ffa9b76787","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$，$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$。$p$ 为候选函数图；$D=\\operatorname{dom}(p)$。原子公式和自由变量见 [[17-df-atomic-formula]]、[[17-df-free-variable]]；$\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$ 及有限元组满足关系见 [[17-df-type]]、[[17-df-tuple-satisfaction]]。$\\bar a:n\\to D$，$p\\circ\\bar a$ 为复合元组。$\\operatorname{PartIso}$ 只在固定语言 $L$ 下省略下标。空部分映射允许作候选，但仍须保持无自由变量的原子句。定义不要求 $D$ 对函数符号封闭。"},{"id":"e50619e8ca5f10b0","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\omega$; $p,q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$ (formula families, see [[17-df-type]])."},{"id":"5a24147c3ffbf113","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"086b1b3d5b60a929","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$ is from [[17-df-type]], and tuple satisfaction is from [[17-df-tuple-satisfaction]]."},{"id":"e1c067a42f0c312e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 为一阶语言，$n\\in\\omega$；$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$ 见 [[17-df-structure]]。$\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$，其中 $\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$ 见 [[17-df-type]]；$\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^n$。有限元组满足记号取 [[17-df-tuple-satisfaction]]。以下定义的三个谓词只在这些输入上使用，$L$ 和显示元数 $n$ 均保留在签名中。"},{"id":"e6a4ebf476ad2f6d","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S_1(T_{\\mathfrak A,B})$ (complete $1$-types over $B$, see [[17-df-type]])"},{"id":"8ad251400f2bb592","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$ (formulas in $n$ displayed variables, see [[17-df-type]])"},{"id":"d88aa28a0fcc379a","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$ 见 [[17-df-type]]；$\\mathfrak B\\models\\varphi[\\langle b\\rangle\\frown\\bar c]$ 是 [[17-df-satisfaction]] 的参数满足关系。"},{"id":"a41374cf828233e6","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 为一阶语言；$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$ 见 [[17-df-structure]]；$p$ 是候选公式集，$\\bar a$ 是候选有限元组。$\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$ 见 [[17-df-type]]；$\\operatorname{RealizesTuple}_{L,n}$ 与 $\\operatorname{Realizes}_{L,n}$ 见 [[17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets]]。以下定义 $\\operatorname{Realizes}(\\mathfrak A,\\bar a,p)$ 和 $\\operatorname{Realized}_{\\mathfrak A}(p)$，并在各自定义式内部绑定元数；对 $p\\in\\operatorname{Type}_n(T)$ 的原有调用仍适用。"},{"id":"bac86ffe2826b946","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S_n(T)$ (set of complete $n$-types, see [[17-df-type]])"},{"id":"c8c9b6ed48fe2f37","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$，$\\mathfrak C\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$ 且 $\\operatorname{Saturated}_{\\aleph_1}(\\mathfrak C)$，见 [[17-df-cardinal-saturation]]。\n全载体加名采用 [[17-df-language-constants]]、[[17-df-diagram]] 的 $L(\\mathfrak C)$ 与规范扩张；$T_C,F_C$ 在下式定义。\n$\\operatorname{ElemDiag}$ 见 [[17-df-elementary-diagram]]，$\\mathrm{Form}_{L(\\mathfrak C),1}$、$S_1(T_C)$ 按加名语言实例取 [[17-df-type]] 的接口。\n$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$，$\\varphi\\in F_C$；$\\mathrm{Ord}$ 与 $\\mathrm{Finite}$ 见 [[17-df-ordinals-finiteness]]。\n$\\operatorname{Residual}_{\\mathfrak C}$、$\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathfrak C}$、$\\operatorname{Rank}_{\\mathfrak C}$ 按 $\\alpha$ 超限递归；$\\operatorname{RM}_{\\mathfrak C}$ 定义域为 $F_C$。\n本接口的 $-1,\\infty$ 是下式编码的两个非序数标记，不在此处进行整数运算或扩展实数运算。"},{"id":"a628b44ab2781524","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 为一阶语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$。$|L|$ 与 $\\aleph_0$ 见 [[17-df-language-cardinality]]；$\\operatorname{Complete}$ 见 [[17-df-theory-properties]]；$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ 见 [[17-df-model]]。$\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$ 见 [[17-df-type]]；$\\models_T$ 与 $\\operatorname{Complete}_{T,n}$ 见 [[17-df-complete-formula]]；$\\operatorname{Atomic}_T$ 见 [[17-df-atomic-model]]。实现公式集谓词 $\\operatorname{Realizes}_{L,n}$ 见 [[17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets]]。证明使用 [[17-df-local-omission]] 的局部省略及 [[17-thm-extended-omitting-types]]。"},{"id":"a56231382327ecde","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_{L'}$ and $\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$ (sentences and formulas, see [[17-df-sentence]] and [[17-df-type]])"},{"id":"ca75e0773ad7e836","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_{L'}$ and $\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$ (sentences and $n$-variable formulas, see [[17-df-sentence]] and [[17-df-type]])"},{"id":"7a9661711dbc540e","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 为一阶语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$。$|L|$ 与 $\\aleph_0$ 见 [[17-df-language-cardinality]]；$\\operatorname{Complete}$ 见 [[17-df-theory-properties]]；$S_n(T)$ 见 [[17-df-type]]；$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ 见 [[17-df-model]]。$m:\\omega\\to\\omega$，$(p_n)_{n\\in\\omega}$ 为公式集序列。$\\operatorname{Realized}_{\\mathfrak A}$ 见 [[17-df-type-realization]]，$\\operatorname{NonIsolated}_T$ 见 [[17-df-non-isolated-types]]；两接口均在内部绑定有限元数。一般公式集的实现及局部省略见 [[17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets]]、[[17-df-local-omission]]，证明使用 [[17-thm-extended-omitting-types]]。"},{"id":"400a658908591f62","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 为一阶语言，语言大小 $|L|$ 见 [[17-df-language-cardinality]]，$\\aleph_0$ 为最小无限基数。$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ 见 [[17-df-sentence]]；一致性谓词 $\\operatorname{Consistent}$ 与模型类 $\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ 见 [[17-df-theory-properties]]、[[17-df-model]]。$m:\\omega\\to\\omega$，$(\\Sigma_r)_{r\\in\\omega}$ 为公式集序列，且每个 $\\Sigma_r\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_{L,m(r)}$，见 [[17-df-type]]。局部省略与模型省略分别取 [[17-df-local-omission]] 和 [[17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets]]；$\\operatorname{card}(X)$ 为集合基数。"},{"id":"99ff69edbf76f2a7","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"在 [[17-thm-los]] 所列 ZFC 元理论中，$I$ 非空，$(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}$ 为 $L$-结构族，$U$ 是 $I$ 上的超滤子。$P$ 及 $[f]_U$ 取其超积构造的乘积与商类；商结构记号见 [[17-df-ultraproduct-notation]]。$\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$ 与元组满足分别见 [[17-df-type]]、[[17-df-tuple-satisfaction]]。"},{"id":"b51a9d2d7c819846","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"在含选择公理的 ZFC 元理论中工作，见 [[17-ax-zfc]]。$I$ 是非空集合，$(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}$ 为 $L$-结构族，$U$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U)$，见 [[17-df-ultrafilter]]。$\\mathfrak B$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Ultraproduct}_L((\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I},U,\\mathfrak B)$；其乘积载体 $P$ 和商类 $[f]_U$ 见 [[17-df-ultraproduct]]。$\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$ 为自由变量包含于 $\\{v_j:j<n\\}$ 的公式集，见 [[17-df-type]]；元组满足记号见 [[17-df-tuple-satisfaction]]。$\\bar f\\in P^n$ 为代表元的有限元组。"},{"id":"378c046219546f74","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$ (formulas in displayed variables, see [[17-df-type]])"},{"id":"979cffef60954613","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S_n(T)$ and $\\operatorname{Realized}$ (complete types and realization, see [[17-df-type]] and [[17-df-type-realization]])"},{"id":"af5c01a198d6e923","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S_n(T)$ and $\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$ (complete types and formulas, see [[17-df-type]])"},{"id":"84d09aff18243439","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S_n$ (complete-type space, see [[17-df-type]])"},{"id":"13c73c6f79ee78a7","anchor":"ref-31","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-type]]"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-140","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-compactness]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem]]\n[[17-df-aleph-one-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-aleph-zero-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-algebraic-closure]]\n[[17-df-assignment]]\n[[17-df-assignment-predicate]]\n[[17-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model-notation]]\n[[17-df-bool-co